    "kp_type": "property",
    "module": "CPLX",
    "section_id": "SEC-BX2-09-01",
    "sub_section_id": null,
    "difficulty": 4,
    "importance": "master",
    "statement": "共轭复数的性质：(1) $\\bar{\\bar z}=z$，即一个复数的共轭复数的共轭是它自己；(2) 取共轭与四则运算可交换，即对和、差、积、商取共轭，等于先分别取共轭后再作相应运算（作商时除数非零）；(3) $\\bar z=z$ 是 $z$ 为实数的充要条件。",
    "latex": "\\overline{z_1\\pm z_2}=\\bar z_1\\pm\\bar z_2,\\quad \\overline{z_1z_2}=\\bar z_1\\bar z_2,\\quad \\overline{\\left(\\frac{z_1}{z_2}\\right)}=\\frac{\\bar z_1}{\\bar z_2}",
